1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,140
Todo dia minha mãe

2
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:03,180
fazia duas marmitas,

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,140
uma era minha

4
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:05,540
e a outra ela

5
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,740
levava até o portão.

6
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,980
Eu reclamava que ela

7
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,320
já trabalhava tanto

8
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,160
e ainda ia cozinhar

9
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,840
pros outros, mas ela

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,120
continuava fazendo

11
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,600
as duas.

12
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,740
Um dia fui atrás

13
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,980
dela e vi

14
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,380
um senhor devolvendo

15
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,120
a vasilha lavada,

16
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,180
embrulhada num pano.

17
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:25,260
Minha mãe ajeitou

18
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,360
a gola da camisa

19
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,920
dele e perguntou

20
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,860
se tinha comido

21
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,280
tudo, chamando

22
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,060
aquele senhor

23
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,540
de professor.

24
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,670
Esperei ele ir

25
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:35,310
embora e perguntei

26
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:35,750
de onde

27
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,150
se conheciam.

28
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:38,250
Ela disse que ele

29
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:39,230
a ensinou a ler

30
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,110
quando não tinha

31
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,310
dinheiro nem pro

32
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:42,510
caderno.

33
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:43,410
No dia seguinte

34
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,910
acordei mais cedo

35
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,210
e quando minha mãe

36
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,690
entrou na cozinha,

37
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,350
as duas marmitas já

38
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:51,090
estavam prontas.
